# Copy lock and canonical copy

Before editing, check for COPY LOCK blocks.

- If a block is inside `<!-- COPY LOCK START: canonical -->` and `<!-- COPY LOCK END: canonical -->`, do not edit it.
- Only edit unlocked blocks.
- Prefer verbatim wording from `copy-bank.md` for any Serene description.
- Do not paraphrase canonical phrases unless needed for POV (The User page must be 2nd person).

Locked sections in HTML must not be edited unless COPY LOCK tags are removed (see note at top of `copy-bank.md`).
